BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Garden We Dreamed
DTSTART:20260510T033000Z
DTEND:20260510T052500Z
DTSTAMP:20260510T033000Z
UID:VoD6RoZNAA
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 100 mins (1h40m)\n\nA Haitian family migrating throu
 gh Mexico becomes entangled in illegal logging. Amid fleeting stability an
 d the forest’s quiet beauty\, they confront violence\, survival\, and de
 struction\, testing their hope for a place to call home. Director Joaquín
  Del Paso scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/the-garden
 -we-dreamed\n\nEstimated start: 20:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
