BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lucky Lu
DTSTART:20260512T033000Z
DTEND:20260512T053000Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T033000Z
UID:w1gsQMbVwV
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 103 mins (1h43m)\n\nA NYC delivery rider’s world i
 s turned upside down when he loses his only source of income. With his fam
 ily on their way from Asia\, Lu is forced to navigate the unforgiving city
  and fight to protect the fragile life he’s spent years building.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.siff.net/festival/lucky-lu\n\nEstimated start: 20:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:If I Go Will They Miss Me
DTSTART:20260513T010000Z
DTEND:20260513T025000Z
DTSTAMP:20260513T010000Z
UID:WLJauu8ffG
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 92 mins (1h32m)\n\nExpanded from an award-winning Su
 ndance short\, Walter Thompson-Hernández infuses empathy in this lyrical 
 feature about a sensitive boy in Watts who constructs a mythological imagi
 nation for his family\, contrasting sharply with their complicated reality
 .\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/if-i-go-will-they-miss-me\n\nEstimated 
 start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Burn
DTSTART:20260513T033000Z
DTEND:20260513T053000Z
DTSTAMP:20260513T033000Z
UID:ZqwoNr4OeL
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 103 mins (1h43m)\n\nWhen runaway teen Ju-Ju is embra
 ced by a tribe of misfit youths in Kabukicho\, she finds belonging for the
  first time — until betrayal and despair twist her haven into a prison. 
 From the director of We Are Little Zombies.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festi
 val/burn\n\nEstimated start: 20:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
