BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:EIGHT BRIDGES
DTSTART:20260514T033000Z
DTEND:20260514T051000Z
DTSTAMP:20260514T033000Z
UID:ab0k5uktXm
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 82 mins (1h22m)\n\nThere is something hypnotically a
 lluring about James Benning’s work. With only eight shots\, each of a di
 fferent bridge\, it’s like taking more than a cursory look at a gallery 
 painting: the longer you look\, the deeper you see.\n\nhttps://www.siff.ne
 t/festival/eight-bridges\n\nEstimated start: 20:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Becoming Human
DTSTART:20260515T010000Z
DTEND:20260515T025500Z
DTSTAMP:20260515T010000Z
UID:c4oENs119w
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 99 mins (1h39m)\n\nIn this award-winning debut\, Pol
 en Ly presents a meditative story about a guardian spirit of an abandoned 
 Battambang cinema who must decide whether to become a homeless spirit afte
 r the building’s demolition or become human again.\n\nhttps://www.siff.n
 et/festival/becoming-human\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
