UID:JhrpuP8CWa
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 81 mins (1h21m)\n\nFrom visually poetic mood pieces 
 to found-footage mash-ups\, this year’s collection ranges from somber to
  surreal to hilarious.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/alt-shorts\n\nEsti
 mated start: 20:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
