UID:Nsru4AfYD0
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 109 mins (1h49m)\n\nEach time Shadhu tries to leave 
 his wife behind\, a fruit drops from the palm tree\, and she finds her way
  back. Mejbaur Rahman Sumon’s Roid is part folk tale\, fable\, and somet
 hing harder to name.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/roid\n\nEstimated st
 art: 17:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
