SUMMARY:Reality Check
DTSTART:20260516T190000Z
DTEND:20260516T205000Z
DTSTAMP:20260516T190000Z
UID:unLWAa9Hpg
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nThese inventive and enlightening 
 nonfiction shorts highlight the quiet—and in one case quite loud—ways 
 that people assert their dignity in times of war\, disaster\, division\, a
 nd competitive burping.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/reality-check\n\n
 Estimated start: 12:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
